<!-- Bootstrap Grid Flow

Container
   ↓
Row (Horizontal line)
   ↓
Col (Vertical boxes)
   ↓
Card / Content

.container → Page ko center + padding deta hai.
.row       → Ek horizontal row banata hai.
.col       → Har item ko ek column bana deta hai.
.card      → Bootstrap ka ready-made card design deta hai.

Rule:
col hamesha row ke andar use hota hai. -->
